sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Candidate as 🧑‍🎓 Applicant
    actor Admin as 👔 Admissions Officer
    participant PublicPortal as 🌐 Admissions Portal
    participant AdminPortal as 🖥️ Staff Portal
    participant AdmEngine as ⚙️ Admissions Service
    participant MeritEngine as 🧮 Merit Computation Engine
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    Candidate->>PublicPortal: Submits Application Form + Transcripts
    PublicPortal->>AdmEngine: POST /api/v1/admissions/apply
    AdmEngine->>DB: Create Applicant & Application (status = APPLIED)
    AdmEngine-->>PublicPortal: Application Number Generated (e.g. APP-2026-089)

    Admin->>AdminPortal: Reviews candidate documents
    AdminPortal->>AdmEngine: PATCH /api/v1/admissions/applications/:id/status { status: SHORTLISTED }
    AdmEngine->>DB: Update Application status

    Admin->>AdminPortal: Schedules Entrance Exam session
    AdminPortal->>AdmEngine: POST /api/v1/admissions/tests/assign-slot
    AdmEngine->>DB: Create AdmissionTest record & assign candidates
    AdmEngine-->>Candidate: Email/SMS Entrance Exam Slip

    Candidate->>PublicPortal: Appears in Entrance Exam
    Admin->>AdminPortal: Enters exam test marks
    AdminPortal->>AdmEngine: POST /api/v1/admissions/tests/results
    AdmEngine->>DB: Create AdmissionTestResult

    Admin->>AdminPortal: Triggers Merit List Calculation for Program
    AdminPortal->>MeritEngine: Calculate Aggregate Scores
    Note over MeritEngine: Aggregate = (50% Matric/Inter) + (50% Entry Test)
    MeritEngine->>DB: Generate MeritListEntry records ranked 1..N
    MeritEngine-->>AdminPortal: Merit List Draft Ready

    Admin->>AdminPortal: Publishes Official Merit List
    AdminPortal->>AdmEngine: POST /api/v1/admissions/merit-list/:programId/publish
    AdmEngine->>DB: Update Application status = ADMITTED
    AdmEngine-->>Candidate: Admission Offer Letter & Fee Challan Sent

    Candidate->>PublicPortal: Uploads Paid Admission Challan
    PublicPortal->>AdmEngine: POST /api/v1/admissions/applications/:id/admit
    AdmEngine->>DB: Atomic Tx [Create User (STUDENT), Create Student profile, status = ENROLLED]
    AdmEngine-->>Candidate: Welcome Email with Student Roll No & Portal Credentials
